AI tutors or virtual doctors (for EdTech & HealthTech) & "Add a modular, cloud-native SaaS platform that provides tailored B2B software services for industries including Technology, Education, Healthcare, Finance, E-Commerce, Travel, Business, and Entertainment. Each module should include domain-specific features, built on microservices architecture, with API-first design, and support for third-party integrations. Implement RBAC, multi-tenant support, and containerized deployment (Docker/Kubernetes). Ensure compliance (e.g., HIPAA, GDPR, PCI), and build CI/CD pipelines for rapid deployment. Use scalable databases (e.g., PostgreSQL, MongoDB) and integrate AI services for personalization, automation, and analytics. Frontend: React or Vue. Backend: Node.js, Django, or Go." We are developing an enterprise-grade SaaS platform targeting eight major high-growth verticals: Technology, Education, Health, Finance, E-Commerce, Travel, Business Services, and Entertainment. Each solution is vertical-specific, solving industry pain points like workflow inefficiency, customer engagement, and compliance. The platform is scalable, cloud-based, and designed with a recurring revenue model. Our competitive edge lies in customizable, AI-integrated tools and a white-label architecture for B2B resale. With the global SaaS market projected to exceed $300B, our multi-sector approach positions us to capture diversified market share while mitigating industry-specific risks." For Marketing / Sales Teams

"Introducing a powerful all-in-one platform that empowers businesses across industries — from tech startups to hospitals, schools, online stores, travel agencies, and entertainment companies. Our software suite is built to solve real problems: automate workflows, track sales, manage customers, streamline operations, and deliver intelligent insights. Whether you’re in education managing students, in healthcare scheduling patients, or in retail selling products online — we’ve got a tailored solution. Plus, it’s all-in-one, easy to use, and customizable. Say goodbye to juggling tools — and hello to growth."

# Database Configuration
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/guidesoft_db

# Server Configuration
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development

# Frontend Configuration
REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
REACT_APP_ELASTICSEARCH_ENABLED=true

# Security
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_here
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# Search Configuration
DEFAULT_BATCH_SIZE=100
MAX_DOCUMENTS=1000
SEARCH_TIMEOUT=300000

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=info